# Codanna + Copilot workspace instructions

## Use Codanna for code understanding
- Run Codanna semantic search before modifying unfamiliar code.
- Share the exact Codanna command and summarize the top results.
- Follow relationships with `codanna mcp get_calls`, `codanna mcp find_callers`, or `codanna mcp analyze_impact`.
- For symbols, use `codanna retrieve describe <symbol|symbol_id:ID>`.

## Editing & validation
- Keep edits atomic and scoped to the request.
- Run existing lint/test commands when available.
- If you can’t run a command, say so and explain the next best verification step.

## Accuracy policy
- Don’t invent VS Code commands, settings, or tool capabilities.
- If a capability is missing, say so and propose a workaround.

## Logging & traceability
- When using Codanna, include the query and limit to improve repeatability.
